[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_2vl73")
from = "Gideon "
to = "Smog-Riders "
subject = "In-depth Operations Details "
content = " Hello again. Gideon here. 
 
 Tomorrow is the raid against the Los Sangrientos warehouses but some unfortunate news has come up.  Our keeper of wares have informed me that we are short on long-range weaponry and higher-grade ballistic vests. 
 
 This will mean that we have to use a hit-and-run strategy and rely on ambushes. 
 
 Luckily, we’re pretty sure the Los Sangrientos are not expecting a raid tomorrow, so we will have the element of surprise on our side, which has been proven to work before. 
 
 I haven’t lived for 38 years just to die tomorrow. We’ll win! For the sake of Cloud City. 
 
 -Gideon"
